OL,3,AChief medical officer Gregor Smith
OL,4,Aresigns on mental health grounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's chief medical officer, Sir
OL,7,FGregor Smith, has resigned on mental
OL,8,Fhealth grounds.
OL,10,FThe 55-year-old, who has served in the
OL,11,Fposition since December 2020, has faced
OL,12,Fquestions over his role in the handling
OL,13,Fof avoidable deaths at NHS Grampian in
OL,14,Frecent weeks.
OL,16,FSmith said in a statement that he did
OL,17,Fnot "currently enjoy the good mental
OL,18,Fhealth necessary" to continue in the
OL,19,Fjob, adding that guiding the country
OL,20,Fthrough the Covid pandemic and its
OL,21,Faftermath had "taken its toll".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
